The image is in flash at $1F800000 (the boot loader is at $1FC00000), the top $10000 (64k) of the flash contains the nvram and there is 64k of "lang" below this.

To debrick this box you require a version of wrt54g.exe that has been modified to handle the big endian cpu. Also beware that the cfe commands think the cfe is at the bottom of flash rather than at $1fc00000! See [[toh:netgear:dg834gt#recovery|DG834GT]] about the endian problem.

